#. 苗木よ、実はな…
msgctxt "0001 | SAKURA OOGAMI"
msgid "You know, Makoto..."
msgstr ""

#. 我は…悩んでいる事があるのだ…
msgctxt "0002 | SAKURA OOGAMI"
msgid "There's something that's been concerning me."
msgstr ""

#. え？　悩みって…？
msgctxt "0003 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "What...?"
msgstr ""

#. この学園にはトレーニング機器も揃っている。
#. お陰で助かっている。だが…
msgctxt "0004 | SAKURA OOGAMI"
msgid ""
"This school has all kinds of exercise equipment, which\n"
"is great..."
msgstr ""

#. この環境では…
#. 我の望むトレーニングは出来んのだ…
msgctxt "0005 | SAKURA OOGAMI"
msgid ""
"...but it still doesn't offer everything I need to\n"
"complete my training."
msgstr ""

#. お陰で、日に日に弱くなっていく自分を
#. 感じている…
msgctxt "0006 | SAKURA OOGAMI"
msgid "I feel like I'm getting weaker by the day..."
msgstr ""

#. このまま…それを耐え続けろと言うのか？
#. そんな事…我には出来ん…
msgctxt "0007 | SAKURA OOGAMI"
msgid ""
"Am I supposed to just accept that? Accept my atrophy?\n"
"I...I can't do it..."
msgstr ""

#. このままでは…我は…我は…！
msgctxt "0008 | SAKURA OOGAMI"
msgid "If something doesn't change, I'll...I'll...!"
msgstr ""

#. ちょ、ちょっと大神さん！
#. 落ち着いてよ！
msgctxt "0009 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "I-It's okay, Sakura! Just hang in there!"
msgstr ""

#. 焦る気持ちはわかるけど…
#. 早まっちゃ駄目だって…！
msgctxt "0010 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"I know how impatient you must feel, but you can't rush\n"
"these things...!"
msgstr ""

#. ………………
msgctxt "0011 | SAKURA OOGAMI"
msgid "..."
msgstr "..."

#. …って言うか、大神さんが望むトレーニングって、
#. どんなトレーニングなの？
msgctxt "0012 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "But when you say it doesn't have everything you need to complete your training...what do you mean?"
msgstr ""

#. 我は近代的トレーニングを認めていない。
#. いわゆる、機械に頼ったトレーニングをな…
msgctxt "0013 | SAKURA OOGAMI"
msgid ""
"Well, I can't say I'm a huge fan of modern training\n"
"techniques, which rely mainly on machinery."
msgstr ""

#. 確かに、あれは筋力アップには適している。
#. だが、筋力があれば強くなるとも限らん。
msgctxt "0014 | SAKURA OOGAMI"
msgid ""
"That's good for building muscle mass, but that doesn't\n"
"necessarily translate to actual strength."
msgstr ""

#. 筋肉はあればあるほど良いが、
#. それを力まずに使うのがコツが必要だ。
msgctxt "0015 | SAKURA OOGAMI"
msgid ""
"More muscle is better, of course, but you also need to\n"
"know how to use it."
msgstr ""

#. 逆に、筋力アップしようとして筋肉が固くなり、
#. 怪我しやすくなった例も存在する…
msgctxt "0016 | SAKURA OOGAMI"
msgid ""
"And if you're not used to it, pushing your muscles too\n"
"hard can lead to injury."
msgstr ""

#. レスリングの一流選手の中には、
#. ロープ登り以外の筋トレは一切しない者もいるらしい。
msgctxt "0017 | SAKURA OOGAMI"
msgid ""
"There are even some world-class wrestlers who only\n"
"build muscle by climbing ropes and things like that."
msgstr ""

#. それに、総合格闘技では、
#. 瞬発力や敏捷性、持久力、全身の協調性が必要なのだ。
msgctxt "0018 | SAKURA OOGAMI"
msgid ""
"In mixed martial arts, speed, agility, and endurance\n"
"are all necessary parts of total body coordination."
msgstr ""

#. それらを鍛える為には、
#. 一か所だけの筋肉を鍛えるやり方ではなく…
msgctxt "0019 | SAKURA OOGAMI"
msgid ""
"If that's your goal, you can't just focus on one\n"
"aspect of your training."
msgstr ""

#. スイング式の懸垂など自重の筋トレや、
#. 全身を使うパワー系の筋トレが必要なのだが…
msgctxt "0020 | SAKURA OOGAMI"
msgid ""
"For example, kipping pull-ups can train one area,\n"
"while power training equipment works multiple areas."
msgstr ""

#. …聞いているか？
msgctxt "0021 | SAKURA OOGAMI"
msgid "...Are you listening?"
msgstr ""

#. …えっ？　聞いてるよ！　もちろん！
msgctxt "0022 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "Huh? Oh, yeah! Yes, absolutely! Got it!"
msgstr ""

#. 自重の筋トレなら、なんとかなるが…
#. 全身を使うパワー系の筋トレが難しい…
msgctxt "0023 | SAKURA OOGAMI"
msgid ""
"Weight-free training is an option, sure, but power\n"
"training is a much greater challenge."
msgstr ""

#. 我は幼少の頃より、
#. 欠かさず行っているトレーニングがあるのだが…
msgctxt "0024 | SAKURA OOGAMI"
msgid ""
"I've had my own training method ever since I was a\n"
"little child."
msgstr ""

#. 古タイヤをある物で叩くというトレーニング方法だ。
#. おい聞いているか？
msgctxt "0025 | SAKURA OOGAMI"
msgid ""
"For example, I'd take an old tire and hit it with\n"
"everything I had. ...Are you still listening?"
msgstr ""

#. き、聞いてるよ…！
msgctxt "0026 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "Y-Yeah, totally!"
msgstr ""

#. では、言ってみろ…
msgctxt "0027 | SAKURA OOGAMI"
msgid "So, what did I say?"
msgstr ""

#. 我が幼少の頃より行っているのは、
#. 古タイヤを何で叩くトレーニングだと思う？
msgctxt "0028 | SAKURA OOGAMI"
msgid "What did I use to hit that tire I mentioned?"
msgstr ""

#. え…？　言ってみろって…！？
msgctxt "0029 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "What!? Are you sure you said it!?"
msgstr ""

#. ………………
msgctxt "0030 | SAKURA OOGAMI"
msgid "..."
msgstr "..."

#. <CLT 4>無言のプレッシャー…
#. 答えないと、大神さんから怒られそうだ…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0031 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>This silence is deafening. I don't wanna think about\n"
"what Sakura might do if I don't answer...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. ハンマー
msgctxt "0032 | CHOICE/RE:ACT"
msgid "A hammer"
msgstr ""

#. 拳
msgctxt "0033 | CHOICE/RE:ACT"
msgid "Your fist"
msgstr ""

#. 拳で叩く、とか…
msgctxt "0034 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "You hit it with, y'know...your fist."
msgstr ""

#. やはり聞いていなかったのか？
#. 我は…
msgctxt "0035 | SAKURA OOGAMI"
msgid "So you *weren't* listening..."
msgstr ""

#. 全身を使うパワー系の筋トレが難しいと
#. 言ったのだが？
msgctxt "0036 | SAKURA OOGAMI"
msgid ""
"Didn't I say I prefer power training which exercises\n"
"the entire body?"
msgstr ""

#. き、聞いてたよ！
#. つまり全身を使うって事だよね！？
msgctxt "0037 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"N-No, I WAS listening! S-Something that uses your\n"
"entire body, right...?"
msgstr ""

#. 真剣
msgctxt "0038 | CHOICE/RE:ACT"
msgid "A sword"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>真剣で切る…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0039 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>You cut it up with a sword!\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>は、ないよな。
#. それはもう総合格闘技の域を超えるし…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0040 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Wait, no...that's beyond just martial arts.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. 口に出さないだけの思慮は働いたか…
msgctxt "0041 | SAKURA OOGAMI"
msgid "You're wise not to speak..."
msgstr ""

#. えっ！
msgctxt "0042 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "What!?"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>こ、心を読まれた！？
#. 大神さんだったら…ありそうだけど…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0043 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>D-Did she read my mind or something!? It's Sakura,\n"
"so...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. ぜ、全身を使った筋トレになるってことだよね？
#. それはつまり……
msgctxt "0044 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "Y-You're talking about a full-body workout, right?"
msgstr ""

#. ………………
msgctxt "0045 | SAKURA OOGAMI"
msgid "..."
msgstr "..."

#. <CLT 4>無言のプレッシャーがまだ…
#. 答えるまでは…このままだろうな…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0046 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>I think I'm gonna keep getting the silent treatment\n"
"till I answer...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>古タイヤを何かで叩くトレーニング…
#. なんとしてでも、答えないと！
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0047 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>What did she use to hit her tire when she was\n"
"training...? I have to answer!\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. ハンマーでタイヤを叩くトレーニングとかなら…
#. どっかで聞いた事あるけど…
msgctxt "0048 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"I think I heard stories about people using giant\n"
"hammers for training like that..."
msgstr ""

#. …そうだ。幼い頃からの日課だ。
#. 体幹強化のトレーニングとしては最適なのだ。
msgctxt "0049 | SAKURA OOGAMI"
msgid ""
"Exactly so. I've been doing that since childhood.\n"
"It's extremely good for your core."
msgstr ""

#. だが、それもここでは不可能だ…
msgctxt "0050 | SAKURA OOGAMI"
msgid "But that kind of thing is impossible here..."
msgstr ""

#. このままでは…弱くなる一方…
msgctxt "0051 | SAKURA OOGAMI"
msgid "And I can feel myself growing weaker..."
msgstr ""

#. だけど、耐えなくちゃ！
#. 耐える事だって強さのはずだよ！？
msgctxt "0052 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"You have to endure it! Enduring this kind of thing is\n"
"part of being strong, isn't it!?"
msgstr ""

#. …む？
msgctxt "0053 | SAKURA OOGAMI"
msgid "...Hm?"
msgstr ""

#. …そのはずだよ？
msgctxt "0054 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "...I think?"
msgstr ""

#. ………………
msgctxt "0055 | SAKURA OOGAMI"
msgid "..."
msgstr "..."

#. 今は<CLT 3>精神面<CLT>を鍛えるトレーニング…
#. そう思う他ないか…
msgctxt "0056 | SAKURA OOGAMI"
msgid "For now, I should focus on training <CLT 3>my mind<CLT>..."
msgstr ""

#. ふむ、苗木に教えられたかもしれんな…
#. <CLT 3>耐える事の大事<CLT>さを…
msgctxt "0057 | SAKURA OOGAMI"
msgid ""
"Hmm...You've taught me something today, Makoto. The\n"
"importance of <CLT 3>endurance<CLT>..."
msgstr ""

#. いや…そんな…
#. 教えるなんて大それた事…
msgctxt "0058 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"W-Well, I mean...I wouldn't call that teaching, per\n"
"se."
msgstr ""

#. 苗木よ、すまなかったな。
#. 悩みなんかを聞いてもらって…
msgctxt "0059 | SAKURA OOGAMI"
msgid "Sorry for making you listen to me complain..."
msgstr ""

#. だが、お陰でスッキリしたぞ。
#. 我はまだ大丈夫そうだ。
msgctxt "0060 | SAKURA OOGAMI"
msgid "But I feel better now. I can handle this..."
msgstr ""

#. やはり、お前に話してよかった…
#. この恩はいずれ返そう…
msgctxt "0061 | SAKURA OOGAMI"
msgid ""
"I'm glad I talked to you. I'll find a way to repay the\n"
"favor..."
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>そう言って、大神さんは静かに
#. その場から去っていった…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0062 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Sakura left, moving quickly for her size.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. 良かった…
#. 少しは役に立てたみたいだな…
msgctxt "0063 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "So...I guess I helped her? That's good..."
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>それに、なんだか大神さんに信頼されているみたいで、
#. ちょっと嬉しかったし…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0064 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>I'm glad to see she's starting to trust me a little\n"
"more.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 23>大神さくらの<CLT><CLT 3>通信簿<CLT><CLT 23>に、今の情報を追記致しました。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0065 | NARRATION"
msgid ""
"<CLT 23>Sakura's <CLT><CLT 3>Report Card<CLT><CLT 23> has been updated based on your\n"
"experience with her.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 23>おめでとうございます。
#. <CLT><CLT 3>“スキルポイント”<CLT><CLT 23>が上がりました。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0066 | NARRATION"
msgid ""
"<CLT 23>Your maximum number of <CLT><CLT 3>Skill Points<CLT><CLT 23> has increased!\n"
"Hey, look at you go!\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>大神さんと別れたボクは、
#. いったん、自分の部屋へと戻る事にした。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0067 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>After we were done, I decided to head back to my room\n"
"for a while...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""
